mmune modulation context, which is relevant to the review topic (X1_microbiome_ICI) even if not the specific biomarker.\n\n    *   *Drafting Useful Material:* Focus on the study's actual content (Vaccination, ICI, Outcomes, Cohort size).\n    *   *Drafting Auxiliary Material:* Focus on the planning card's interpretation (immune priming, tumor specificity).\n    *   *Drafting Remaining Gap:* Explicitly mention UBA6 is not covered.\n    *   *Drafting Outline Action:* Search strategies for UBA6, or framing the lack of data.\n\n    *   *Check:* Did I infer identity? The text says",
